+ * \param nal the set, with its header of two bytes
+ * \return the nuh_layer_id of the second view; nothing where the set declares anything else
+ *
+ * What that decoder takes (libavcodec/hevc/ps.c, decode_vps_ext()): a base layer in the stream
+ * (vps_base_layer_internal_flag and vps_base_layer_available_flag), two layers and no more
+ * (vps_max_layers_minus1 equal to 1), at most two layer sets, and an extension of the set whose
+ * only scalability is multiview. A set that declares one layer is one of a 2D stream; one of
+ * three views or more, of another scalability (spatial, SNR, depth) or of an auxiliary layer (an
